title: Instructions/list_tiddlers

Lists tiddler titles as a ''namespace tree'': titles grouped by common prefix, with a count after each group. By default it covers all ''non-system'' tiddlers.

|!Parameter |!Required |!Description |
|`tag` |no |Filter results to tiddlers with this tag |
|`limit` |no |Maximum number of titles. Applied only when given, or with `flat=true` (default there: 100) |
|`includeSystem` |no |Set to `true` to include `$:/` system tiddlers |
|`plugin` |no |List tiddlers inside a plugin (e.g. `$:/plugins/tiddlywiki/internals` or `$:/core`) |
|`overwrittenShadows` |no |List shadow tiddlers that have been overwritten by real tiddlers |
|`flat` |no |Set to `true` to return raw newline-separated titles instead of the namespace tree summary |

Unless `flat` is set, the output is a namespace tree: each group shows its count in parentheses (e.g. `$:/config/ (252)`). The filter flags are exclusive, in the order `plugin`, `overwrittenShadows`, `tag`, `includeSystem`; only the first one set applies. Drill into a group with `run_filter` and `prefix[]`.

''Example prompts:''

* "List all tiddlers tagged Journal"
* "Show me the first 20 tiddlers"
* "Show me all core tiddlers" — uses `plugin=$:/core`
* "Show me the overwritten shadow tiddlers"
